{"scene_id": "s01748", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01748.fountain", "heading": "INT. DEPOSITION ROOM - CONVERTED BOWLING ALLEY - DAY", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "NADIA FERRANTE", "names": ["NADIA FERRANTE", "NADIA"], "gender": "f", "first": 6, "spoke": 27}, {"id": 1, "name": "ELIAS BRANDT", "names": ["ELIAS BRANDT", "ELIAS"], "gender": "?", "first": 7, "spoke": 27}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. DEPOSITION ROOM - CONVERTED BOWLING ALLEY - DAY", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "A long laminate table has been set up across what used to be lane six.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "Pins are still racked at the far end behind a sheet of clear plastic.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "A court reporter's machine sits unattended, red light blinking.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "Two chairs face each other, one pushed in tight, one angled for escape.", "para": 0, "sent": 3, "present": []}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "A pitcher of water sweats between them.", "para": 0, "sent": 4, "present": []}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "NADIA FERRANTE (40s, attorney, charcoal suit, a legal pad she doesn't need) sits upright, pen capped.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "Across from her, ELIAS BRANDT (60s, retired shipping executive, rumpled blazer, thick hands folded) leans back like a man in a waiting room.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "For the record, Mr. Brandt, please state your name.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You know my name.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "For the record.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Elias Brandt.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you understand you're under oath.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I understand this is a bowling alley.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's the only room the county would lend us.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I used to bowl here. Thursdays.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is that relevant?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Only to me.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "action", "text": "She uncaps her pen.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "action", "text": "She writes the date at the top of the page.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Brandt, on March fourth, did you authorize the transfer of eleven million dollars from the pension fund?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I authorized a loan.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To whom?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "To the company.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which company?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My company.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "So you lent yourself eleven million dollars of other people's retirement.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I lent it to the business, Ms. Ferrante. The business employs four hundred people.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Employed.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Excuse me?", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Past tense. Four hundred people were employed. Eleven thousand retirees were promised.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't lecture me.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I'm not lecturing. I'm asking.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You're performing. There's no jury.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "There's a record.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then let it record that the market turned.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Brandt, I'm going to show you Exhibit Nine.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "She slides a document across the table.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "He doesn't touch it.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's your signature?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Looks like it.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Is it?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Yes.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And the date next to it?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "March fourth.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And the note in the margin. Read it aloud, please.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "action", "text": "He picks up the paper.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "action", "text": "He reads in a flat voice.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "\"Do not tell the trustees until it is done.\"", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "Silence.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "The reporter's light blinks.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "Down the room, behind the plastic, the pins stand frozen.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Why did you write that?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because they would have said no.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because it was illegal.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Because they were frightened men. Frightened men say no. Somebody had to say yes.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Somebody who would profit.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Somebody who would carry it.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Eleven thousand people are carrying it now.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Don't you speak to me about carrying! I carried those people for thirty years!", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": ["rising, sharply"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sit down, Mr. Brandt.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I put a roof on every one of them!", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Sit down.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "He slams his palm on the table.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 64, "kind": "action", "text": "The pitcher jumps.", "para": 6, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 65, "kind": "action", "text": "Water sloshes over the lip and runs across the laminate, toward the plastic, toward the pins.", "para": 6, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 66, "kind": "action", "text": "Nadia does not flinch.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 67, "kind": "action", "text": "She picks up her pen and writes one line.", "para": 7, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 68, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "What did you just write?", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": ["quieter"], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 69, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "\"Witness became agitated.\"", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 70, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's not what happened.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 71, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Then what happened?", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 72, "kind": "action", "text": "Elias sits.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 73, "kind": "action", "text": "His hand, still wet, trembles on the table.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 74, "kind": "action", "text": "He wipes it on his blazer, slowly, and looks at the lane, at the pins he once knocked down on Thursday nights.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 75, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I was happy here.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 76, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mr. Brandt, that's not responsive.", "name": "NADIA", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 77, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I know it isn't.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 78, "kind": "action", "text": "He lifts his eyes to hers.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 79, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Ask your question again.", "name": "ELIAS", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}]}